    "_note": "A car's body (npm run import: car_<id>.glb; its parts sit under their socket nodes, to be split off by npm run build:car). requiredSockets must be there; expectedSockets should be (parts go there); mirrorTolerance: how far a left socket may be from mirroring its right one",
